	"Text": "Almighty God, all of the best things belong to You. [t] As a sign that we belong to You, root within our hearts a love for Your name. [*] Grow within us a devotion for what nurtures our souls and weave Your love deeper through our lives. Watch over us so that we may flourish and thrive",
